1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,344
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01,344 --> 00:00:05,110
In this lesson, we'll set up
your Conversation AI chatbot.

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:09,525
By the end, it'll know your business,
reply to customers in seconds,

4
00:00:09,525 --> 00:00:14,135
book appointments, and know exactly
when to hand over to a real person.

5
00:00:15,017 --> 00:00:17,589
Go to AI Agents, then Conversation AI.

6
00:00:17,589 --> 00:00:19,282
Here's your list of bots.

7
00:00:19,282 --> 00:00:23,141
Bloom Dental has a front desk
bot that answers enquiries.

8
00:00:23,141 --> 00:00:27,947
You can see its mode, its channels,
and its knowledge base at a glance.

9
00:00:27,947 --> 00:00:29,640
Click the bot to open it.

10
00:00:30,493 --> 00:00:31,884
First, the bot mode.

11
00:00:31,884 --> 00:00:33,970
Off means the bot stays quiet.

12
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:37,587
Suggestive means it drafts
a reply in Conversations,

13
00:00:37,587 --> 00:00:40,369
and your team reviews it before sending.

14
00:00:40,369 --> 00:00:44,333
Auto-pilot means it replies
on its own, around the clock.

15
00:00:45,184 --> 00:00:49,522
Bloom has been in Suggestive mode for
a week, and the drafts look great.

16
00:00:49,522 --> 00:00:51,329
So let's switch to Auto-pilot.

17
00:00:51,329 --> 00:00:54,221
You can see the new mode
next to the bot's name.

18
00:00:55,072 --> 00:00:57,403
Next, choose where the bot can reply.

19
00:00:57,403 --> 00:00:58,600
Let's add WhatsApp.

20
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:03,010
Below that, keep Pause the bot when
a team member replies switched on.

21
00:01:03,010 --> 00:01:07,483
That way, the moment someone on your
team jumps in, the bot steps back.

22
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,353
Now open Personality and goals.

23
00:01:10,353 --> 00:01:12,438
This is where you train the bot.

24
00:01:12,438 --> 00:01:17,912
Describe who it is and how it talks, then
what a successful conversation looks like.

25
00:01:17,912 --> 00:01:21,757
Add any rules in Additional
instructions, like your prices,

26
00:01:21,757 --> 00:01:23,582
and things it must never do.

27
00:01:24,433 --> 00:01:28,007
Under Actions, you decide
what the bot can actually do.

28
00:01:28,007 --> 00:01:32,815
This one books appointments into your
calendars, collects contact details,

29
00:01:32,815 --> 00:01:34,830
and stops once the job is done.

30
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:39,183
Booking actions like these are part
of the advanced chatbot on Pro.

31
00:01:40,033 --> 00:01:41,781
Every bot needs a way out.

32
00:01:41,781 --> 00:01:44,335
Click Add action, then Human handover.

33
00:01:44,335 --> 00:01:49,445
Describe when to hand over, like when
someone asks for a person, is unhappy,

34
00:01:49,445 --> 00:01:50,588
or mentions pain.

35
00:01:50,588 --> 00:01:54,218
Assign the conversation to
Sarah, add a tag, and save.

36
00:01:55,069 --> 00:01:59,703
Then open the Knowledge Base tab, and
make sure your knowledge base is attached.

37
00:01:59,703 --> 00:02:04,570
This is where the bot finds answers about
your treatments, prices and opening hours.

38
00:02:04,570 --> 00:02:06,771
We'll build it out in the next lesson.

39
00:02:07,621 --> 00:02:10,324
Before it talks to real
customers, test it.

40
00:02:10,324 --> 00:02:13,969
On the right, type a question,
just like a customer would.

41
00:02:13,969 --> 00:02:15,540
"How much is Invisalign?"

42
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:19,374
The bot answers from your price
list, and offers a free scan.

43
00:02:20,224 --> 00:02:22,621
Let's say yes, and ask for Thursday.

44
00:02:22,621 --> 00:02:24,286
The bot offers two times.

45
00:02:24,286 --> 00:02:28,813
Pick 11:30, and it books the free
scan, straight into your calendar.

46
00:02:31,397 --> 00:02:32,282
Happy with it?

47
00:02:32,282 --> 00:02:32,977
Click Save.

48
00:02:32,977 --> 00:02:38,032
Then, back on the main page, the Dashboard
shows how many conversations your bot

49
00:02:38,032 --> 00:02:42,202
handled, appointments it booked,
and chats it passed to your team.

50
00:02:42,202 --> 00:02:45,109
Conversation history
lets you read every chat.

51
00:02:45,961 --> 00:02:47,633
A quick note on plans.

52
00:02:47,633 --> 00:02:51,814
Growth includes the basic
chatbot for replies and FAQs,

53
00:02:51,814 --> 00:02:54,626
with each AI message billed at $0.04.

54
00:02:54,626 --> 00:02:58,502
Pro adds the advanced bot,
with unlimited messages.

55
00:02:59,354 --> 00:03:00,486
Here's a pro tip.

56
00:03:00,486 --> 00:03:03,415
Run a new bot in
Suggestive mode for a week.

57
00:03:03,415 --> 00:03:06,478
Every time you edit a
draft before sending it,

58
00:03:06,478 --> 00:03:10,407
add what you changed to its
instructions or knowledge base.

59
00:03:10,407 --> 00:03:13,203
Then switch on Auto-pilot with confidence.

60
00:03:14,052 --> 00:03:15,354
Your chatbot is live!

61
00:03:15,354 --> 00:03:19,447
In the next lesson, we'll build
the knowledge base it learns from,

62
00:03:19,447 --> 00:03:22,423
with your website, your
documents and your FAQs.

63
00:03:22,423 --> 00:03:23,291
See you there.
